{"slug":"o_clock","word":"o'clock","rank":5340,"category":"adverbs","pos":"adv","gloss":"indication of time (the translations below are of \"one o’clock\")","definitions":["In conjunction with a numeral, indicates the time within a twelve-hour period (midnight to noon or noon to midnight), specifically the time when the hour hand of a clock points precisely to the symbol or marking corresponding to the designated numeral, i.e., at the hour.","Used to indicate that it is time to do a specific action, or time for a specific action to occur.","In conjunction with a numeral, indicates the direction, relative to the speaker or a vehicle, especially an aircraft, corresponding to the direction the hour hand is pointing at the time corresponding to the numeral, with twelve representing directly ahead on a horizontal plane, or directly up on a vertical plane, and three being to the right on either."],"translations":{"af":[{"w":"eenuur"}],"ar":[{"w":"الساعة الواحدة","r":"as-sāʕa al-wāḥida","g":"f"}],"be":[{"w":"гадзіна","r":"hadzina","g":"f"},{"w":"першая","r":"pjeršaja","g":"f"}],"bn":[{"w":"একটা বাজে","r":"ekṭa baje"}],"bs":[{"w":"sati","src":"ai"}],"bg":[{"w":"един часа","r":"edin časa"}],"ca":[{"w":"la una","g":"f"},{"w":"la una en punt"}],"zh-Hans":[{"w":"一点钟","r":"yī diǎnzhōng"}],"zh-Hant":[{"w":"一點鐘","r":"yī diǎnzhōng"}],"cs":[{"w":"hodin","src":"ai"}],"da":[{"w":"klokken et"}],"nl":[{"w":"één uur"}],"eo":[{"w":"la unua"}],"et":[{"w":"kell üks"}],"fil":[{"w":"ala-una"}],"fi":[{"w":"kello yksi"},{"w":"yksi"}],"fr":[{"w":"une heure"}],"gl":[{"w":"en punto","src":"ai","low":1}],"ka":[{"w":"პირველი საათი","r":"ṗirveli saati"}],"de":[{"w":"ein Uhr"}],"el":[{"w":"μία η ώρα","r":"mía i óra","g":"f"}],"he":[{"w":"השעה אחת","r":"hasha'á akhát","g":"f"}],"hi":[{"w":"एक बजा","r":"ek bajā"}],"hu":[{"w":"egy óra"}],"is":[{"w":"klukkan eitt"}],"id":[{"w":"jam satu"},{"w":"pukul satu"}],"ga":[{"w":"a haon a chlog"}],"it":[{"w":"l'una"},{"w":"l'una in punto"},{"w":"l'una esatta"}],"ja